.TH "AG\-CLI\-RELEASE\-EDIT" "1" "2026\-10\-09" "AtomGit CLI 0.7.4" "AtomGit CLI Manual"
.SH NAME
\&ag\-cli\-release\-edit \- Edit a release
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
\&ag\-cli release edit [<owner>/<repo>] <tag> [flags]
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
\&Edit an existing release identified by its tag.
.PP
\&When OWNER/REPO is omitted, the repository is inferred from the current Git repository. An explicit OWNER/REPO argument always takes precedence. Remote selection prefers remote.pushDefault, the current branch upstream, origin, then a unique AtomGit/GitCode remote.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-b, \-\-body <string>\fR
\&New release body text
\&Default: \(dq\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-F, \-\-body\-file <string>\fR
\&Path to file containing new release body
\&Default: \(dq\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-\-latest\fR
\&Set release status to latest (release_status=latest)
\&Default: \(dqfalse\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-n, \-\-name <string>\fR
\&New release name
\&Default: \(dq\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-\-prerelease\fR
\&Set release status to prerelease (release_status=pre)
\&Default: \(dqfalse\(dq.
.SH INHERITED OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h, \-\-help\fR
\&Show help for command
\&Default: \(dqfalse\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-\-raw\-output\fR
\&Disable terminal output sanitization for machine processing
\&Default: \(dqfalse\(dq.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
\&ag\-cli release edit owner/repo v1.0.0 \-\-name \(dqFirst Release\(dq
\&  ag\-cli release edit owner/repo v1.0.0 \-\-latest \-\-body\-file notes.md
\&  ag\-cli release edit owner/repo v1.0.0\-rc \-\-prerelease
.fi
